ll experience flash flooding include...\nCedar Bench Wilderness.\n\nThis includes the following creeks, washes and rivers...\nBull Run Creek, Verde River, Gap Creek, Little Ash Creek and Chasm\nCreek.","instruction":"Flooding of washes and creeks will occur, some dirt roads will become\nmuddy and impassable. Paved roads and underpasses could become\nflooded as well.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FFSFGZ"],"WMOidentifier":["WGUS75 KFGZ 090356"],"NWSheadline":["FLASH FLOOD WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL 1015 PM MST THIS EVENING FOR YAVAPAI COUNTY"],"flashFloodDetection":["RADAR INDICATED"],"flashFloodDamageThreat":["CONSIDERABLE"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.KFGZ.FF.W.0097.000000T0000Z-260809T0515Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-08T22:15:00-07:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["FFS"],"NationalWeatherService":["FFW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e9d2a96b153f5424cf47750e177be29d6f9f4fb5.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-79.17,41.63],[-79.41,41.67],[-79.61,41.73],[-79.61,41.85],[-79.4,41.81],[-78.95,41.71],[-78.95,41.64],[-78.96,41.63],[-78.96,41.62],[-79.14,41.63],[-79.17,41.63]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e9d2a96b153f5424cf47750e177be29d6f9f4fb5.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e9d2a96b153f5424cf47750e177be29d6f9f4fb5.001.1","areaDesc":"Warren, PA","geocode":{"SAME":["042123"],"UGC":["PAC123"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/PAC123"],"references":[{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.abe090e30dedfe3b1d7099340a48b71f8abc7cca.001.1","identifier":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.abe090e30dedfe3b1d7099340a48b71f8abc7cca.001.1","sender":"w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov","sent":"2026-08-08T21:27:00-04:00"}],"sent":"2026-08-08T23:04:00-04:00","eff